SUMMARY:Mobile Apps
DESCRIPTION:Al-Qadisiyah University Apps Al-Qadisiyah University&rsquo;s official apps are available on the iOS App Store and Google Play. Students, faculty, and staff can access digital university services directly from their phones.\nAvailable Apps Al-Qadisiyah University Official App The university&rsquo;s primary mobile portal — includes:\nLatest news and announcements Quick access to the Student Portal (SIS) Academic calendar College and department information Campus map Contact directory 📱 Download:\nApp Store (iOS) Google Play (Android) Library App In partnership with the Digital Library:\nCatalogue search Book reservations and renewals Access to research databases E-journals and e-books 📱 Download:\nApp Store (iOS) Google Play (Android) System Requirements iOS: Version 13 or later Android: Version 8.0 or later Internet connection required for most features Support &amp; Feedback To report an issue or suggest a feature:\n📧 Email: apps@qu.edu.iq 📝 Technical support form Editor note: Update the store links once published, and add app screenshots to static/media/.\n
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
